DTEND:20260827T180000Z
SUMMARY:🏆 Champions League - League Phase Draw
LOCATION:UEFA HQ\, Route de Geneve 46\, 1260 Nyon\, Switzerland
GEO:46.379444;6.226389
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Route de Geneve 46, 1260
  Nyon, Switzerland";X-APPLE-RADIUS=200;X-TITLE="UEFA HQ":geo:46.379444,6
 .226389
DESCRIPTION:Champions League league phase draw\nThursday 27 August 2026\n
 \n17:00 UK time\, from UEFA headquarters in Nyon.\n\n36 clubs drawn into
  four pots of nine. Each club is drawn against two teams from every pot\
 , one home and one away.\n\nAfter this\, the full fixture list is releas
 ed and this calendar can be rebuilt with actual matches.
CATEGORIES:Champions League,Draw
URL:https://www.uefa.com/uefachampionsleague/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ucl-2627-2026-09-08@claude-ucl
DTSTAMP:20260801T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260908
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:🏆 Champions League - Matchday 1
DESCRIPTION:Champions League - Matchday 1 (day 1 of 3)\nTuesday 8 Septemb
 er 2026\n\nNotes\nOpens a week earlier than last season\, and unusually 
 spread over three days. A full month then follows before Matchday 2 beca
 use of an extended international break.\n\n72nd season\, second under th
 e 36-team league phase format. Each club plays eight different opponents
 \, four home and four away.\\n\\nTop eight go straight to the last 16\; 
 ninth to 24th enter a two-legged knockout play-off. PSG are two-time def
 ending champions after beating Arsenal on penalties in Budapest.\\n\\nSi
 x Premier League clubs qualified - the largest representation of any cou
 ntry.\\n\\nFIXTURES ARE NOT YET KNOWN. The league phase draw is on 27 Au
 gust 2026\, so these entries mark the matchday windows only. Kick-offs a
 re normally 17:45 and 20:00 UK time on Tuesday and Wednesday.
CATEGORIES:Champions League,Matchday 1
URL:https://www.uefa.com/uefachampionsleague/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
