DESCRIPTION:Champions League - Round of 16 - 2nd leg (day 1 of 2)\nTuesda
 y 16 March 2027\n\n72nd season\, second under the 36-team league phase f
 ormat. Each club plays eight different opponents\, four home and four aw
 ay.\\n\\nTop eight go straight to the last 16\; ninth to 24th enter a tw
 o-legged knockout play-off. PSG are two-time defending champions after b
 eating Arsenal on penalties in Budapest.\\n\\nSix Premier League clubs q
 ualified - the largest representation of any country.\\n\\nFIXTURES ARE 
