SUMMARY:🏆 CHAMPIONS LEAGUE FINAL
LOCATION:Estadio Metropolitano\, Av. de Luis Aragones 4\, 28022 Madrid\, 
 Spain
GEO:40.436111;-3.599444
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Av. de Luis Aragones 4, 
 28022 Madrid, Spain";X-APPLE-RADIUS=300;X-TITLE="Estadio Metropolitano":
 geo:40.436111,-3.599444
DESCRIPTION:UEFA Champions League Final\nSaturday 5 June 2027\n\nEstadio 
 Metropolitano\, Madrid - its second final after Liverpool beat Tottenham
  there in 2019.\n\nThe latest date the final has been held in the modern
  era\, since 1992. Kick-off time to be confirmed\; recent finals have be
 en 20:00 UK time.\n\nPSG go for a third straight title.
CATEGORIES:Champions League,Final
